      "body": "Thanks for taking a look. The purpose of CpuidFeatureSamples is to let the postconditions refer to the register values read during this invocation. The existing CPUID specification leaves each call’s results unconstrained, so we cannot assume that another read would return the same values.\r\n\r\nmax_leaf records the first read’s EAX for the leaf gate, while feature_bits records the queried ECX/EBX value, or None if the function returns early. Together, they let us specify the exact Boolean result and its relationship to the leaf gate.",
      "created_at": "2026-11-13T11:06:13Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-11-13T11:06:13Z",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/asterinas/vostd/pull/920#discussion_r4562531929",
